  "description": "Lee Bobae just wants her family to be reunited. She wishes for her oldest brother to return from the rift, her second brother to become awakened, and her third brother to wake up from his coma. Miraculously, her wishes come true, but with unexpected consequences. With one brother turned into an edge lord and two others acting like characters straight out of novels, Bobae has her hands full. But more importantly, even though she's the breadwinner, why is she stuck with all the chores around here? \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue chapter.*",
